     If successful, ssyyssccaallll__hheellppeerr__rreeggiisstteerr() and ssyyssccaallll__hheellppeerr__uunnrreeggiisstteerr()
     will return 0.  Otherwise, they will return an error.

EERRRROORRSS
     The ssyyssccaallll__hheellppeerr__rreeggiisstteerr() call will fail and the syscall will not be
     registered if:

     [EINVAL]           The _f_l_a_g_s argument contained a value other than
                        SY_THR_STATIC.

     [EINVAL]           The specified syscall number, sd.syscall_no
                        (SYS_syscallname), was outside of the valid range of
                        system call numbers (zero through SYS_MAXSYSCALL).

     [ENFILE]           The system call table does not have any available
                        slots.

     [EEXIST]           The specified syscall number, sd.syscall_no
                        (SYS_syscallname), was already in use.

